158, "text": "Giving advice"}, {"text": "You should ...", "x": 0.06776596189192263, "h": 0.011869223255543133, "y": 0.4970179974471093, "w": 0.11151465521918402}, {"y": 0.5260465115724479, "text": "Why don't you ...?", "x": 0.06618962520024775, "w": 0.1520572408040365, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"text": "Giving good and bad news", "w": 0.27191413031684025, "h": 0.016489169675090294, "x": 0.06618962762631447, "y": 0.5614169674251684}, {"text": "Guess what!", "x": 0.06797853504349553, "y": 0.5904693139207411, "w": 0.09660107082790799, "h": 0.010207581227436775}, {"text": "I heard that ...", "x": 0.0644007179041335, "y": 0.6183438627794475, "h": 0.011394509094286501, "w": 0.11627906799316405}, {"text": "Paul has passed his driving test!", "x": 0.06417482350655569, "y": 0.6443061466436102, "h": 0.016286337298176308, "w": 0.2598216247558594}, {"x": 0.0626118109531898, "w": 0.13953487820095486, "y": 0.672732558039817, "h": 0.013923579131653152, "text": "Unfortunately, ..."}, {"x": 0.062438638962655404, "w": 0.2132353888617622, "y": 0.6992286416882685, "h": 0.014757222836628767, "text": "I've got some good news."}, {"h": 0.01265904430017569, "y": 0.7270938624469644, "w": 0.28264756944444447, "x": 0.06261181809530901, "text": "I'm afraid I've got some bad news."}, {"text": "WRITING BANK", "y": 0.03533393533794288, "w": 0.22003577338324654, "h": 0.020415162454873646, "x": 0.7209302360543517}, {"y": 0.09736918638526339, "w": 0.07871198018391923, "h": 0.015174417977728975, "text": "Inviting", "x": 0.5187835440046414}, {"y": 0.12518895399151336, "text": "I'd like to invite you to ...", "h": 0.01536158720939173, "w": 0.21109122382269963, "x": 0.5187835481959847}, {"x": 0.5200140529013015, "y": 0.15117777472936636, "text": "I'd like you to come ...", "w": 0.18527286105685759, "h": 0.01805385475984974}, {"w": 0.24865831163194452, "x": 0.5187835472123947, "y": 0.17941786981614385, "text": "Would you like to come to ...?", "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"h": 0.015311371841155259, "text": "I'm writing to invite you to (Madrid/my party).", "x": 0.5152057234701026, "w": 0.3828264702690972, "y": 0.2072924186680761}, {"x": 0.5152057325859456, "y": 0.23393895344871957, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.30411448160807286, "text": "I hope you can come/join us/make it."}, {"w": 0.289803229437934, "y": 0.2604941863852635, "x": 0.51520571690894, "text": "If you want, you can bring a friend.", "h": 0.015174417977728975}, {"y": 0.2881046475861834, "h": 0.01432849506178481, "text": "Join us today!", "x": 0.5151570435039562, "w": 0.11816534254286026}, {"h": 0.012916007644432997, "w": 0.18288542005750863, "x": 0.5167981323431463, "text": "Come and meet me...", "y": 0.31604367315849374}, {"w": 0.20214669121636286, "text": "Why don't you come ...?", "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.5134168137090517, "y": 0.34509476532233024}, {"text": "Maintaining contact", "x": 0.5134168157335002, "h": 0.016438953558030083, "y": 0.38062500012956046, "w": 0.20214669121636286}, {"x": 0.5152057318811367, "h": 0.012727520483065285, "y": 0.4097093025867989, "w": 0.21109122382269963, "text": "Drop me a line sometime."}, {"y": 0.43617779782018157, "x": 0.5116279133659493, "text": "I hope to hear from you soon.", "h": 0.014133574007220224, "w": 0.24686940511067712}, {"y": 0.4640523464778329, "w": 0.159212883843316, "h": 0.01141276953452761, "x": 0.5134168152190695, "text": "Give me a call later."}, {"x": 0.5116279230665187, "w": 0.3166368272569444, "text": "Let me know if you can make it or not.", "h": 0.013909883895075253, "y": 0.49063953481245504}, {"w": 0.22361358642578122, "x": 0.5098390065784032, "y": 0.5184593026289501, "text": "I was glad to hear about ...", "h": 0.01272752048306509}, {"h": 0.016946918112276294, "text": "Let me know as soon as possible.", "y": 0.5432105119086325, "w": 0.2743045383029513, "x": 0.5095691583690294}, {"y": 0.5728023463611516, "w": 0.28085866292317707, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.5080500942763364, "text": "Email or text me and let me know."},